<title>USA: Cornerstones MUD, Texas, won by Southwest Sec..</title>
<headline>Cornerstones MUD, Texas, won by Southwest Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities, Inc. said it won $2.650 million of Cornerstones Municipal Utility Dist, Texas, general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.96 percent.</p>
